WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Osric Penhale>This arrived in a shoebox with a very polite note.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:28.000
<v Imelda Thornquist>Old paper capacitors dry out. They are the first thing I replace in any set.

00:18:05.000 --> 00:18:12.000
<v Imelda Thornquist>The dim-bulb tester is just a lamp in series. If the bulb glows bright, something is shorted.

00:30:40.000 --> 00:30:45.000
<v Wren Halloway>It plays. It actually plays.
